# Magvault camera profile
name: Sony A7S III
id: sony-a7siii

# Detection
vendor: Sony
# model: the string the camera writes in its clip metadata (Sony body code), not the
# marketing name. No A7S III reference card has been checked yet: card_layout and
# filename_pattern below are unverified; the model string decides when the card has it.
model: ILCE-7SM3
card_layout: DCIM, PRIVATE
filename_pattern: A001_C*.mov

# Media
file_formats: ProRes RAW, XAVC S, XAVC HS
default_format: ProRes RAW

gamma: S-Log3, S-Log2, S-Cinetone, Rec.709
default_gamma: S-Log3

gamut: S-Gamut3.Cine, S-Gamut3, Rec.709
default_gamut: S-Gamut3.Cine

# Optional technical hints
typical_resolutions: 3840x2160, 1920x1080
typical_fps: 24, 25, 30, 50, 60, 120
audio_channels: 2, 4

notes: Full-frame cinema camera. S-Log3 + S-Gamut3.Cine is the usual pair. Detection rules unverified (no reference card yet).
